<title>POLAND: Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks rose, one fell and seven were flat in 7.9-million-zlotys Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday.</p>
<p>The remaining seven stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose to 148 zlotys in a 34.9-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
